<div class="columnArticleClass two-layout-bg-white" id="oneColumnArticleTheme"><div class="text-start container multitextblock "><div class="row justify-content-left"><div class="col col-md-8"><h2>Why SIPROTEC 7UT87?</h2><p>The SIPROTEC 7UT87 is a modular transformer differential protection relay. We designed it for multi-winding transformers to support up to five sides and safeguard your critical assets. </p><p>Protect complex multi-winding transformers and systems with many measuring points like phase shifter, FACTS and converter transformers, arc furnace transformers and HVDC transformers. Our SIPROTEC 7UT87 provides comprehensive main and backup protection with flexible functions supported by DIGSI 5. </p><p>Enhance fault detection with up to three differential and five ground fault differential protection functions. Use up to 20 three-phase current and voltage measuring points for extensive monitoring. Its modular hardware allows flexible I/O expansion. Conformal coating supports high availability in tough environments.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div id='66FLXBbpH62pNjcyTJGCU2' class='sitesThreeColTiles themed-component-wrapper' data-ste-section='three-col-tiles_2' data-ste-section-id='66FLXBbpH62pNjcyTJGCU2'>
