<div><div class="section-heading mb-4 container text-start" data-ste-element="Sites: Section Heading"><div><div class="row text-start"><div class="col col-md-8"><h2 class="header-focus"><span>Key benefits</span></h2></div></div></div></div><div class="container three-column-tile"><div class="row"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Improve control" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Improve control</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>Ensure safe, reliable automation and control for your systems. Improve operational stability, reduce risks, and build an efficient infrastructure with consistent performance.</p></div></div></div><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Simplify device and software management" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Simplify device and software management</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>Enjoy a simple, user-friendly interface for the device and software that reduces complexity and training time. Operate systems confidently with intuitive control for all functions.</p></div></div></div><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Perform in extreme environments" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Perform in extreme environments</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>Maintain high availability in tough conditions with conformal coating on electronic boards for continuous operation.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id='1BwfZYyOA4pFPqQ1VA5ZFf' class='sitesCardsContainer themed-component-wrapper' data-ste-section='cards-container_3' data-ste-section-id='1BwfZYyOA4pFPqQ1VA5ZFf'><is-land on:visible><div id="comp-1BwfZYyOA4pFPqQ1VA5ZFf" class="CardsContainer" data-component-type="CardsContainer"><section id="1BwfZYyOA4pFPqQ1VA5ZFf" class="cards-defaultBackground" role="region" aria-labelledby="section-heading-1BwfZYyOA4pFPqQ1VA5ZFf"><div class="section-heading mb-4 container text-start" data-ste-element="Sites: Section Heading"><div><div class="row text-start"><div class="col col-md-8"><h2 class="header-focus"><span>Featured capabilities</span></h2></div></div></div></div><div class="container"><div class="row cards-container-row"><div class="siemens-cards col-md-6"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="card" data-ste-teaser-title="Differential protection functions" id="G_Differential%20protection%20functions-0" class="card blogWrapNoLink rounded-0" role="article" aria-labelledby="G_Differential%20protection%20functions-0-title" aria-describedby="G_Differential%20protection%20functions-0-desc" tabindex="0"><div class="card-body d-flex flex-column p-3"><strong class="text-kicker pb-2 mb-0 text-color"></strong><div class="category d-none">all</div><h3 id="G_Differential%20protection%20functions-0-title" class="pb-4 mb-0">Differential protection functions</h3><div id="G_Differential%20protection%20functions-0-desc" class="text-black card-text pb-3 mb-0"><div><p>Apply up to three differential protection functions with stabilization across transformer groups. Use up to five ground fault differential protection functions for comprehensive coverage to protect your multi-winding transformers.</p></div></div><div data-area="card-info-section" class="d-flex flex-column justify-content-end h-100"></div></div></div></div><div class="siemens-cards col-md-6"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="card" data-ste-teaser-title="Measuring points" id="G_Measuring%20points-1" class="card blogWrapNoLink rounded-0" role="article" aria-labelledby="G_Measuring%20points-1-title" aria-describedby="G_Measuring%20points-1-desc" tabindex="0"><div class="card-body d-flex flex-column p-3"><strong class="text-kicker pb-2 mb-0 text-color"></strong><div class="category d-none">all</div><h3 id="G_Measuring%20points-1-title" class="pb-4 mb-0">Measuring points</h3><div id="G_Measuring%20points-1-desc" class="text-black card-text pb-3 mb-0"><div><p>Use up to 20 three-phase current, 20 single-phase current, 20 three-phase voltage and 20 single-phase voltage measuring points. Acquire comprehensive data for detailed system analysis and precise protection.</p></div></div><div data-area="card-info-section" class="d-flex flex-column justify-content-end h-100"></div></div></div></div><div class="siemens-cards col-md-6"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="card" data-ste-teaser-title="Communication protocols" id="G_Communication%20protocols-2" class="card blogWrapNoLink rounded-0" role="article" aria-labelledby="G_Communication%20protocols-2-title" aria-describedby="G_Communication%20protocols-2-desc" tabindex="0"><div class="card-body d-flex flex-column p-3"><strong class="text-kicker pb-2 mb-0 text-color"></strong><div class="category d-none">all</div><h3 id="G_Communication%20protocols-2-title" class="pb-4 mb-0">Communication protocols</h3><div id="G_Communication%20protocols-2-desc" class="text-black card-text pb-3 mb-0"><div><p>Integrate up to four communication modules for various redundant protocols. Use virtual network sharing and PRP, HSR protocols for reliable data transmission. </p></div></div><div data-area="card-info-section" class="d-flex flex-column justify-content-end h-100"></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><template data-island><script type="module" src="/shared-assets/1f5459c4589ce8f899743c2f1031e839981f40d9/lib/helpers/esm/index.module.js"></script><disw-hydrate component="CardsContainer" props-url="/props/1BwfZYyOA4pFPqQ1VA5ZFf-en-US.json" page-id="4jIGSwYbfBshC6C4KsU8Oe" container="comp-1BwfZYyOA4pFPqQ1VA5ZFf"></disw-hydrate></template></div></is-land></div><div id='3tVTOWqRQcwR8ZkfY56LpN' class='sitesThreeColTiles themed-component-wrapper' da